ure","src":"images/5a68ac50543efc46b6daed0a66afefe6f0fff49cc1983c032030d5efff09f8d2.png","width":172,"height":369,"width_mm":20.082,"row_group":"zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.\n(1) 等容；减小  2分\n(2) 状态 1 的物理量: 温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1} = t_{1} + 273 = 27 + 273 = 300"},{"type":"text","value":"(K),\n泡内气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_1 = p_0 - x_1 = 75 - 15 = 60"},{"type":"text","value":"(cmHg) 1分\n状态 2 的热力学温度："},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2} = t_{2} + 273 = -5 + 273 = 268"},{"type":"text","value":"（K）。\n由查理定律求状态 2 的泡内压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":":"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_{1}}{T_{1}}=\\frac{p_{2}}{T_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{2}=\\frac{268\\times60}{300}=53.6(cmHg)"},{"type":"text","value":" 1分\n水银面高度"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2}=p_{0}-p_{2}=75-53.6=21.4\\ (cm)"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n(3) 标注时环境实际压强为 72 cmHg，因此泡内实际压强："},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\text{实}1}=72-15=57\\ cmHg"},{"type":"text","value":"（实验者误将此状态的泡内压强当成 60 cmHg），此时实际温度"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{\\text{实}1}=300\\ K"},{"type":"text","value":"（即 27°C）。\n当显示温度为 “"},{"type":"math","value":"-5^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"” 时，管内水银面高度 x=21.4 cm（由 (2) 得），此时泡内实际压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{\\text{实}2}=75-21.4=53.6"},{"type":"text","value":"（cmHg）。\n泡内气体始终做等容变化，故："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_{1\\text{实}}}{T_{1\\text{实}}}=\\frac{p_{2\\text{实}}}{T_{2\\text{实}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2\\text{实}}=\\frac{53.6\\times300}{57}=282.1(K)"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n实际摄氏温度"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{\\text{实}2}=282.1-273=9.1^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n温度为"},{"type":"math","value":"-5^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"，差值为："},{"type":"math","value":"9.1-(-5)=14.1^{\\circ}C"},{"type":"text","value":"。  1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q16","paper_id"