athrm{U}}{\\mathrm{b}} = \\mathrm{evB}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{U} = \\mathrm{Bvb}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由 I = nevbd\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"U = \\frac{BI_{H}}{ned}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{U} = K_{H}I_{H}\\mathrm{B}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{B} = \\frac{U}{K_H I_H} = 2 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(3) 由"},{"type":"math","value":"P = I^2 R_L"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"P = 24\\mathrm{W}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"B = KI,\\quad I = 2\\mathrm{A}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{IR}_L = I_H(\\mathrm{R} + R_H)"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{H} = 2\\times 10^{3}\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"R_{H} = \\rho \\frac{c}{bd}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho = \\frac{R_Hbd}{c} = 0.1\\Omega \\cdot \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q17","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhejiang-qixiao-2605","source_question_id":"zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"9c9b2ed113f9c84b432fc532e099c79d052483e07668c1fd2f13318349688489","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）如下图所示为一游戏装置的示意图。一光滑轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABCDEF"},{"type":"text","value":" 由3部分拼接而成，分别是半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r = 0.2\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的半圆弧 "},{"type":"math","value":"ABC"},{"type":"text","value":"，半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.4\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的半圆弧 "},{"type":"math","value":"CDE"},{"type":"text","value":"，和水平部分 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":"，两半圆弧直径 "},{"type":"math","value":"AC"},{"type":"text","value":" 与 "},{"type":"math","value":"CE"},{"type":"text","value":" 在同一竖直线上， "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 的右侧有