t{gR}=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n此时弹簧的弹性势能为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{c}^{2}+mg(2r)=6J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n(2)先求到 F 点的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P} + mgR = \\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F} = 2\\sqrt{5}m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n假定小滑块能到第一个半圆弧最高点，且此时小物块的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，小车的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"由水平方向动量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{F}=mv_{1}+2mv_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n由能量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} m v_{F}^{2} = \\frac{1}{2} m v_{1}^{2} + \\frac{1}{2} 2 m v_{2}^{2} + m g (r + R)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n可解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5} + 2\\sqrt{2}}{3} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2} = \\frac{2\\sqrt{5} - \\sqrt{2}}{3} m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"m g - F _ {N} = m \\frac {(v _ {1} - v _ {2}) ^ {2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N}=5N"},{"type":"text","value":"，即小物块受小车的支持力为5N，\n由牛顿第3定律，小物块对小车有向下的力，且为5N （1分）\n(3) 首先要使得小物块不脱离左侧轨道，"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P} \\geq 6J"},{"type":"text","value":"假定物块恰好能冲上第2个半圆的最高点，设此时在F处的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}"},{"type":"text","value":"，物块和小车有共同的速度v\n由水平方向动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{F}=3mv"},{"type":"text","value":"由能量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}=\\frac{1}{2}(3m)v^{2}+\\mu mgL+mg(r+R)"},{"type":"text","value":"可解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=6m/s,\\quad v=2m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"此时"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}+mgR=\\frac{1}{2}mv_{F}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{P}=14J"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n① 当"},{"type":"math","value":"6J \\leq E_P \\leq 14J"},{"type":"text","value":"时，小物块可越过第一个半圆弧最高点，不能越过第二个半圆弧最高点，后相对于小车中管道左右运动，并最终和管道相对静止。"},{"type":"math","value":"E_P + mgR = \\frac{1}{2} mv_F^2"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_F = \\sqrt{2E_P + 8}(m/s)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）小车的最终速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac{1}{3} v_F = \\frac{1}{3}\\sqrt{2E_P + 8}(m/s)"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）② 当"},{"type":"math","value":"E_P > 14J"},{"type":"text","value":"时，小物块可通过第二个半圆最高点，并从小车右侧滑出管道。\n由动量守恒："},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{F} = mv_{1} + 2mv_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"由能量守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2} mv_F^2 = \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 +\\frac{1}{2} (2m)v_2^2 +\\mu mgL"},{"type":"text","value":"可解得："},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = \\frac{v_{F} + 2\\sqrt{v_{F}^{2} - 18}}{3}, v_{2} = \\frac{v_{F} - \\sqrt{v_{F}^{2} - 18}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"又"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F} = \\sqrt{2E_{P} + 8}"},{"type":"text","value":"因此小车最终的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2E_{P} + 8} - \\sqrt{2E_{P} - 10}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q18","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhejiang-qixiao-2605","source_question_id":"zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"36554a3f8a24e5616f12b2c880cc7126e31fd139a2f0c34a789611d22238455e","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）气泡室是高能物理与核物理实验中探测带电粒子轨迹的核心装置（如图甲所示），其原理是利用高压下的过热液体，在带电粒子经过时迅速汽化形成气泡，从而清晰勾勒出粒子的运动轨迹。若粒子在气泡室内运动时，所受阻力与速率成正比，比例系数为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k"},{"type":"text","value":"。某次核物理衰变研究中，科研人员建立如图乙所示建立平面直角坐标系，在坐标原点 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" 处有一静止的 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{92}^{238}\\mathrm{U}"},{"type":"text","value":" 原子核发生衰变，衰变后生成 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{90}^{234}\\mathrm{Th}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和另一未知粒子 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":"，该未知粒子获得一个大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 的沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向的速度。现在第一、四象限加大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac{3 k v_0}{8 e}"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴负方向的匀强电场，第二、三象限加大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":"，方向垂直于纸面向里的匀强磁场（取 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{92}^{238}\\mathrm{U}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"238m"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{90}^{234}\\mathrm{Th}"},{"type":"text","value":" 质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"234m"},{"type":"text","value":"，元电荷的电量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"e"},{"type":"text","value":"）。\n（1）写出 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{92}^{238}\\mathrm{U}"},{"type":"text","value":" 衰变的核反应方程，若核能全部以动能形式释放，试计算该核反应中的质量亏损；\n（2）已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{90}^{234}\\mathrm{Th}"},{"type":"text","value":" 始终在第二、三象限运动，最终静止在 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 处，试求：\n① "},{"type":"math","value":"{}_{90}^{234}\\mathrm{Th}"},{"type":"text","value":" 在磁场中运动的总路程；\n② "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的坐标；\n（3）未知粒子 "},{"type":"math","value":"P"},{"type":"text","value":" 到达第四象限某点 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，速度与 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向夹角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"，试确定此时 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 点的横坐标（已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin53^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\cos53^{\\circ}=0.6"},{"type":"text","value":"）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/915fb6c4bb78549b295846056ab2a3fc95dee7162c4949bc1928d26006f102ca.png","width":327,"height":421,"width_mm":38.427,"row_group":"zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f26515fc6f163578772278f4300d05ca4dbdd57147f0ad121342a824095aa61b.png","width":572,"height":553,"width_mm":67.142,"row_group":"zhejiang-qixiao-2605-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18